OL,3,GNEWSARoad remains closed after         
OL,4,Aindustrial site fire                   
OL,6,FA section of road remains closed       
OL,7,Ffollowing a fire on an industrial      
OL,8,Festate that led to fire crews issuing a
OL,9,Fwarning over asbestos.                 
OL,11,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service crews were
OL,12,Fcalled to reports of a blaze at the    
OL,13,Fsite on Douglas Road in Kingswood, on  
OL,14,Fthe edge of Bristol, in the early hours
OL,15,Fof Sunday morning.                     
OL,17,FThe flames were extinguished by 09:00  
OL,18,FGMT on Sunday and no injuries were     
OL,19,Freported. A cause for the fire has not 
OL,20,Fyet been established.                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
