OL,3,GNEWSARoad remains closed after         
OL,4,Aindustrial site fire                   
OL,6,FA spokesperson from South              
OL,7,FGloucestershire Council said that a    
OL,8,Fsection of the road remains closed     
OL,9,Fafter the fire "led to debris falling  
OL,10,Ffrom the roof", and said the council   
OL,11,Fwas working to reopen the road "as soon
OL,12,Fas possible."                          
